{"game": "mass-effect-3", "language": "english", "appid": 1238020, "month": "2026-04", "window": 1, "start_date": 1775001600, "end_date": 1777593599, "month_true_total": 12, "quota": 12, "returned": 12, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 19:55:30 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "224296783", "author": {"steamid": "76561198342413593", "personaname": "adam666", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198342413593/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 3465, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 648, "last_played": 1777904004, "avatar": "fc66a51442f930d688c5868aff9f4727b079cf5a"}, "language": "english", "review": "A great ending to an amazing trilogy\r\ngreat upgrades to gameplay from the last game\r\ngreat narrative structure", "timestamp_created": 1777395515, "timestamp_updated": 1777395515, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "224146834", "author": {"steamid": "76561199361260925", "personaname": "Apollo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199361260925/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 52, "playtime_forever": 15055, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 481, "last_played": 1778208995, "avatar": "120cebeb5e4d8d0e5599f473682dfb2d0553dfc2"}, "language": "english", "review": "PEAK!!!!\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1777214913, "timestamp_updated": 1777214913, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.488628298044204712", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223938109", "author": {"steamid": "76561198282544778", "personaname": "ripley243", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198282544778/", "num_games_owned": 47, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 2000, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1538, "last_played": 1777408730, "avatar": "1df3535a6f4c9bcf76d310fff46700d18b98412c"}, "language": "english", "review": "As one of the (apparently) few who played Andromeda before this one, I have to say the emotional whiplash is MASSIVE. Andromeda is so peaceful compared to the heaviness of the original trilogy... My ending in ME3 nearly made me cry :')", "timestamp_created": 1776979128, "timestamp_updated": 1776979128, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223936968", "author": {"steamid": "76561198856255288", "personaname": "SKY", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198856255288/", "num_games_owned": 815, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 1926, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1926, "last_played": 1776924344, "avatar": "4d61c2f19d6bd0efa9f66b54370c4cf51a6f0471"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's a good game, it just... fell off at the end but is a good game, would recommend? Yes, I would. But if you wanna play it i would say go for the Legendary Edition instead, you would have a better time there if you wanna play just the main story and forget about the multiplayer part of this game... that for some reason they forced you to play it if you wanna get the other endings or you would have to literally do everything in this game to get a high enought war assets to get the \"best ending\" and the choices you made in ME2 has a lot of influence in this game for the same reason... war assets, and talking about the endings, we all know that only one of the three has a real continuation chance if they someday make Mass Effect 4.\n\nA real solid good game, good combat, the best of the series, good characters, new ones and old ones, the Citadel DLC and the Leviathan DLC are among my personal favourites of the franchise even tho i got extremely scared at the end of the Leviathan DLC, you know... you are all alone under the ocean inside a mech looking for... I don't wanna talk about it, a must-play trilogy.\n\nAnd I chose the blue alien girlfriend for the third time. We are not cheaters in here! 10/10 would play the whole trilogy again.", "timestamp_created": 1776977861, "timestamp_updated": 1776978660, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.482892692089080811", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223818350", "author": {"steamid": "76561198035690657", "personaname": "Greybaugh", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198035690657/", "num_games_owned": 74, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 4725, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1564, "last_played": 1778375175, "avatar": "10d283109ecfd019e0cf9bf6b928f122d0c6ddfd"}, "language": "english", "review": "A good ending to a Great trilogy, but only if you have the MEHEM (Mass Effect Happy Ending Mod), otherwise the ending is a BIG let down.", "timestamp_created": 1776825151, "timestamp_updated": 1776825151, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223733902", "author": {"steamid": "76561199090773691", "personaname": "T-Rexboy45", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199090773691/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 380, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 191, "last_played": 1785617801, "avatar": "53ca19f4afec66ae44ad12cf764e63ab70c9c1f2"}, "language": "english", "review": "goooooooooooooooooooooooood", "timestamp_created": 1776721423, "timestamp_updated": 1776721423, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223666827", "author": {"steamid": "76561198049042640", "personaname": "Ilasuran", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Ilasuran/", "num_games_owned": 934, "num_reviews": 181, "playtime_forever": 2156, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2156, "last_played": 1776640714, "avatar": "6ce344b3b824e1aa92deead4a66d59fb7102e73c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pretty good", "timestamp_created": 1776640716, "timestamp_updated": 1776640716, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223555318", "author": {"steamid": "76561198371901330", "personaname": "Perch_Perkins_Here", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198371901330/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 2654, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2654, "last_played": 1775087726, "avatar": "d0f8f828dcfbf6c40d2cf278f34bef5679912c39"}, "language": "english", "review": "the multiplayer IS STILL ALIVE. do not sleep on this game, it still holds up all these years later. i would recommend playing with a friend or 2 because sometimes its hard to find a game with players. they got rid of the pay to win features so its really satisfying to lvl up and go through the progression system", "timestamp_created": 1776535298, "timestamp_updated": 1776535298, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 11, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.649891495704650879", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223502615", "author": {"steamid": "76561198041535714", "personaname": "andrew.cottrell", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/andrewcottrell/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 2891, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1695, "last_played": 1776910478, "avatar": "b6bff80ffa57b1624844c61e585ef3879866d9bd"}, "language": "english", "review": "Going onto the Normandy bridge (with Joker and EDI) I get stuck almost EVERY TIME and have to save/reload multiple times to get unstuck.  This has apparently been a known problem for YEARS.  Fix your damn game!", "timestamp_created": 1776486536, "timestamp_updated": 1776486536, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.591216206550598145", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "222956695", "author": {"steamid": "76561198057219735", "personaname": "Arilena", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ArilenaStardream/", "num_games_owned": 82, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 5623, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 138, "playtime_at_review": 5374, "last_played": 1791053528, "avatar": "543d0a793372b4caf4ab316103a0b4c2cf263c57"}, "language": "english", "review": "I can't believe the multiplayer is still alive more than two decades later. A friend and I still frequently play it for fun. Yay for being able to play non-humans. What a missed opportunity and a strange decision that Legendary never implemented multiplayer.", "timestamp_created": 1775840375, "timestamp_updated": 1775840375, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 17, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.679446876049041748", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "222762379", "author": {"steamid": "76561198025385886", "personaname": "Gato Gris", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198025385886/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 545, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 503, "last_played": 1777497445, "avatar": "397089fca479aeae49fcc86613b075040bec7f52"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great story", "timestamp_created": 1775590784, "timestamp_updated": 1775590784, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "222702257", "author": {"steamid": "76561198026115878", "personaname": "Devadatta Baraka", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/getfiltered/", "num_games_owned": 454, "num_reviews": 80, "playtime_forever": 3373, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3373, "last_played": 1774928161, "avatar": "51a5fc9713160278527978aa781fbedd97c9d896"}, "language": "english", "review": "Completely functional third person shooter game with a very fun multiplayer mode. DROPS THE BALL ON THE STORY SO HARD I don't even care anymore lol \r\nPAINFUL CRINGE: Illusive Man Flanderization, Rachni Retcon that disrepected choices made by the player all for the sake of a setpiece, proto quirk chungus dialogue that replaces the depth in dialogue from the last two games with dadjokes and banter... annoying weight system, the worst Normandy and the worst squad selection out of the three games... every mission feels like you shoot ad nauseum and a magic wand facilitates where any weight of meaningful decisions gets undercut by the insistence that something cool is happening... but it isn't earned at all logically in the story... this story is less like Mass Effect 2 and more like Shrek. It's full of characters I recognize and all that, but it's almost a parody... Vanguard ruined by replacing barrier with a doofus fist slam... Cool RPG mechanics and depth from the last two ALL BOILED DOWN into Telltale Games fake meat. Also, showed this to hb on Discord he said it looked like God of War Ragnarok lmao\r\nIn 2012 I enjoyed the first two games thoroughly and couldn't finish this one because it just didn't feel right. Now it feels like the seventh seal of everything wrong with games these days.", "timestamp_created": 1775515166, "timestamp_updated": 1775515166, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 11, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.5047607421875", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}]}